[in-game dialogue]

3642
03:05:31,960 --> 03:05:32,960
[in-game dialogue]

3643
03:05:32,960 --> 03:05:33,760
[in-game dialogue]

3644
03:05:33,760 --> 03:05:34,560
[in-game dialogue]

3645
03:05:34,560 --> 03:05:35,560
[in-game dialogue]

3646
03:05:35,560 --> 03:17:05,000
*sighs*

3647
03:17:05,000 --> 03:17:15,000
Are we gonna die?

3648
03:17:15,000 --> 03:17:23,200
Is he saying he'll take us home?

3649
03:17:23,200 --> 03:17:24,200
Whoaaa...

3650
03:17:26,000 --> 03:17:46,920
Korone and Miko-Miko went on a great adventure

3651
03:17:46,920 --> 03:17:51,320
Miko-Miko killed Korone many times

3652
03:17:51,320 --> 03:17:55,870
I did not! I didn't kill you! But she thought it was her own fault

3653
03:17:55,870 --> 03:17:58,870
That too

3654
03:17:58,870 --> 03:18:02,470
That too

3655
03:18:02,470 --> 03:18:04,300
That too

3656
03:18:07,950 --> 03:18:12,060
So this pilot was connected to the police

3657
03:18:12,060 --> 03:18:14,140
And then again, like...

3658
03:18:14,140 --> 03:18:17,130
Going back to square one, it's like an endless loop

3659
03:18:17,130 --> 03:18:20,690
Yeah, I wonder if it'll be okay?

3660
03:18:20,690 --> 03:18:28,540
Wow, it looks almost like live-action

3661
03:18:28,540 --> 03:18:29,540
Right?

3662
03:18:29,540 --> 03:18:32,340
This game is really well made

3663
03:18:32,340 --> 03:18:35,770
Oh, we've arrived

3664
03:18:35,770 --> 03:19:40,350
But we did take down Harvey

3665
03:19:40,350 --> 03:19:41,730
Yeah, that's true

3666
03:19:41,730 --> 03:19:43,260
Yeah

3667
03:19:43,260 --> 03:19:45,340
We're innocent

3668
03:19:45,340 --> 03:19:46,140
Innocent

3669
03:19:46,140 --> 03:19:47,940
Not innocent

3670
03:19:47,940 --> 03:19:49,940
Not innocent

3671
03:19:49,940 --> 03:20:52,660
We've seen this place before, right?

3672
03:20:52,660 --> 03:20:54,660
I wonder if there's more to it

3673
03:20:54,660 --> 03:23:07,630
What happened?

3674
03:23:07,630 --> 03:23:11,230
So they did all this just to track down Harvey

3675
03:23:13,590 --> 03:23:15,390
So that's why they did all that!

3676
03:23:15,390 --> 03:23:38,120
What's behind this?

3677
03:23:49,140 --> 03:23:51,140
Seriously...

3678
03:24:16,540 --> 03:24:19,100
We didn't attack the police though, that's true

3679
03:24:19,100 --> 03:24:19,980
That's true

3680
03:24:19,980 --> 03:24:30,240
I mean, like, we were beating people to death

3681
03:24:30,240 --> 03:24:32,320
Well, more like punching, you know?

3682
03:24:32,320 --> 03:24:33,740
She was getting her eyes gouged out, right?

3683
03:24:33,740 --> 03:24:34,740
Yeah, exactly.

3684
03:24:34,740 --> 03:24:45,410
Oh nooo!

3685
03:24:45,410 --> 03:24:46,410
Oh no, what do I do?!

3686
03:24:49,040 --> 03:24:50,360
Konya konya~

3687
03:24:50,360 --> 03:24:51,200
Look!

3688
03:24:51,200 --> 03:24:53,160
Show this face to the viewers!

3689
03:24:53,160 --> 03:24:57,200
Get a good look at this guy's face!

3690
03:24:57,200 --> 03:24:59,960
We were partners this whole time!

3691
03:24:59,960 --> 03:25:01,260
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

3692
03:25:01,260 --> 03:25:03,340
Get a good look at this guy's face!

3693
03:25:03,340 --> 03:25:05,080
I'm sorry!

3694
03:25:05,080 --> 03:25:09,350
I'm sorry!

3695
03:25:09,350 --> 03:25:14,660
This guy betrayed Miko!

3696
03:25:14,660 --> 03:25:15,860
Everyone, take a good look!

3697
03:25:15,860 --> 03:25:17,980
Everyone, I'm sorry!

3698
03:25:27,650 --> 03:25:30,350
We were partners in crime!

3699
03:25:30,350 --> 03:25:32,630
I'm sorry~!

3700
03:25:32,630 --> 03:25:35,790
Come on, get in!

3701
03:25:35,790 --> 03:25:36,790
Oh, hey!

3702
03:25:36,790 --> 03:25:41,530
Leo!

3703
03:25:41,530 --> 03:25:42,900
He's persistent!

3704
03:25:42,900 --> 03:25:44,470
Oh no!

3705
03:25:44,470 --> 03:25:48,930
But watching Leo's conversations with his family is a little heartbreaking.

3706
03:25:48,930 --> 03:25:50,860
Yeah, it really is.

3707
03:25:50,860 --> 03:25:53,830
Alright, let's go!

3708
03:25:53,830 --> 03:25:54,830
Betray him already!

3709
03:25:54,830 --> 03:26:06,030
I'm not listening to you!

3710
03:26:06,030 --> 03:26:10,540
That was close!

3711
03:26:10,540 --> 03:26:21,140
Drive properly! Hey, Miko Miko!

3712
03:26:21,140 --> 03:26:22,940
I AM driving, look!

3713
03:26:22,940 --> 03:26:24,040
Ahahahaha!

3714
03:26:24,040 --> 03:26:26,020
Hmm~

3715
03:26:26,020 --> 03:26:29,150
Ow~ Sorry!

3716
03:26:29,150 --> 03:26:30,860
Sorry?

3717
03:26:30,860 --> 03:26:33,350
Sorry?

3718
03:26:33,350 --> 03:26:34,350
She said sorry!

3719
03:26:34,350 --> 03:26:36,350
You're saying sorry while holding a shotgun?!

3720
03:26:36,350 --> 03:26:37,650
I'm sorry~

3721
03:26:37,650 --> 03:26:39,450
What do I do?

3722
03:26:39,450 --> 03:26:40,450
Don't do that!

3723
03:26:40,450 --> 03:26:41,450
Oh!

3724
03:26:41,450 --> 03:26:45,220
Phew~

3725
03:27:22,220 --> 03:27:24,150
Let's go, let's go!

3726
03:27:24,150 --> 03:27:24,950
OK!

3727
03:27:24,950 --> 03:27:26,750
Let's go, let's go!

3728
03:27:26,750 --> 03:27:28,750
We're still friends, right?

3729
03:27:28,750 --> 03:27:33,550
Too soft!

3730
03:27:33,550 --> 03:27:35,350
Woohoo!

3731
03:27:35,350 --> 03:27:39,060
No way!

3732
03:27:39,060 --> 03:27:41,780
I only hated you for today!

3733
03:27:41,780 --> 03:27:43,580
You're no friend of mine!

3734
03:27:43,580 --> 03:27:47,940
I'm getting away!

3735
03:27:47,940 --> 03:27:52,310
Stop right there!

3736
03:27:52,310 --> 03:27:54,110
She's not coming!

3737
03:27:54,110 --> 03:27:56,910
Stop right there!

3738
03:27:56,910 --> 03:27:58,620
No way~!

3739
03:27:58,620 --> 03:28:00,510
Stop right there! No fair~!

3740
03:28:00,510 --> 03:28:03,310
Don't come over here!

3741
03:28:03,310 --> 03:28:05,110
Stop shooting!

3742
03:28:05,110 --> 03:28:06,910
I'm not shooting!

3743
03:28:06,910 --> 03:28:10,710
Hey, where are you even shooting?!

3744
03:28:10,710 --> 03:28:11,910
Damn it!

3745
03:28:11,910 --> 03:28:18,510
Stop stop stop stop stop!

3746
03:28:19,680 --> 03:28:22,680
Stop it, stop it! Ow ow ow!

3747
03:28:22,680 --> 03:28:26,480
Ow ow ow!

3748
03:28:26,480 --> 03:28:31,080
Sorry sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

3749
03:28:31,080 --> 03:28:33,060
OK OK OK OK

3750
03:28:33,060 --> 03:28:34,880
Ugh! Oh! Over there!

3751
03:29:05,480 --> 03:29:07,480
You came, huh?

3752
03:29:07,480 --> 03:29:09,480
Why?

3753
03:29:09,480 --> 03:29:12,480
That's dangerous! Seriously!

3754
03:29:12,480 --> 03:29:15,480
That's dangerous!

3755
03:29:15,480 --> 03:29:17,480
Run! Run!

3756
03:29:17,480 --> 03:29:19,480
We're not friends!

3757
03:29:19,480 --> 03:29:21,480
We're friends, aren't we?!

3758
03:29:21,480 --> 03:29:23,480
We are NOT friends!

3759
03:29:23,480 --> 03:29:26,480
Just give yourself up quietly!

3760
03:29:26,480 --> 03:29:34,480
I haven't done anything wrong!

3761
03:29:34,480 --> 03:29:36,480
What's with all this stuff!

3762
03:29:36,480 --> 03:29:40,480
I'm telling you, I didn't kill anyone!

3763
03:29:40,480 --> 03:29:42,480
What are you even talking about!

3764
03:29:42,480 --> 03:29:45,480
It's the brother thing, right?

3765
03:29:45,480 --> 03:29:47,480
It's not just the brother!

3766
03:29:47,480 --> 03:29:49,480
There's just too much piling up!

3767
03:29:49,480 --> 03:29:52,480
Isn't that all the same thing!

3768
03:29:52,480 --> 03:29:55,480
It's fine!

3769
03:29:55,480 --> 03:29:58,480
I'm fine with it!

3770
03:29:58,480 --> 03:30:00,480
Don't give me "I'm fine with it"!

3771
03:30:00,480 --> 03:30:02,480
We're going together!

3772
03:30:04,480 --> 03:30:08,480
Where are you, Miko Miko?

3773
03:30:08,480 --> 03:30:11,480
NO! NO! YES!

3774
03:30:11,480 --> 03:30:13,480
NO!

3775
03:30:13,480 --> 03:30:16,480
Hello, Miko Miko~

3776
03:30:16,480 --> 03:30:19,480
Goodbye, Korone~

3777
03:30:19,480 --> 03:30:22,480
The worst!

3778
03:30:22,480 --> 03:30:25,480
Gender equality is Miko's policy, you know.

3779
03:30:25,480 --> 03:30:30,480
Isn't this, what's it called, obstruction of justice or something?

3780
03:30:30,480 --> 03:30:33,480
NO! YES! We've got no way out now!

3781
03:30:34,480 --> 03:30:36,480
They're coming out! They're coming out!

3782
03:31:04,480 --> 03:31:06,840
You're a dead man, you piece of shit!

3783
03:31:06,840 --> 03:31:08,840
What about your son, Alex?

3784
03:31:08,840 --> 03:31:10,180
Shut the fuck up!

3785
03:31:10,180 --> 03:31:12,180
Don't you mention his name!

3786
03:31:12,180 --> 03:31:14,180
You don't get to mention his name!

3787
03:31:14,180 --> 03:31:16,180
Don't you say my partner's name either!

3788
03:31:16,180 --> 03:31:19,180
You're a dead man, you piece of shit!

3789
03:31:34,410 --> 03:31:36,130
So like...

3790
03:31:36,130 --> 03:31:37,590
It really seems like

3791
03:31:37,590 --> 03:31:39,650
we have to fight each other.

3792
03:31:39,650 --> 03:31:41,590
Seriously?

3793
03:31:41,590 --> 03:31:44,250
No way... Miko Miko...

3794
03:31:44,250 --> 03:31:45,550
It's true.

3795
03:31:45,550 --> 03:31:49,470
I actually really loved Miko Miko.

3796
03:31:49,470 --> 03:31:50,850
Miko too...

3797
03:31:50,850 --> 03:31:52,890
loved Korone

3798
03:31:52,890 --> 03:31:54,290
so much.

3799
03:31:54,290 --> 03:31:57,950
There you are you little shit!

3800
03:32:01,980 --> 03:32:03,980
I've got a son too!

3801
03:32:03,980 --> 03:32:09,050
What is this, what is this?!

3802
03:32:09,050 --> 03:32:13,180
Is this really it?

3803
03:32:13,180 --> 03:32:15,980
Stop, stop, stop, please stop!

3804
03:32:15,980 --> 03:32:17,780
Hey!

3805
03:32:17,780 --> 03:32:20,590
Let's go, let's go!

3806
03:32:20,590 --> 03:32:21,590
What?

3807
03:32:21,590 --> 03:32:23,890
Let's talk it out!

3808
03:32:23,890 --> 03:32:25,490
Okay!

3809
03:32:25,490 --> 03:32:27,410
This way maybe? She said something.

3810
03:32:27,410 --> 03:32:28,590
Where are you?

3811
03:32:28,590 --> 03:32:29,590
Show your face!

3812
03:32:32,320 --> 03:32:37,960
Nyah! Yeah! This is crazy! Oraoraora! Ahahaha!

3813
03:32:37,960 --> 03:32:39,960
Take that! Take that!

3814
03:32:39,960 --> 03:32:47,360
Oraya! No! Wait wait wait wait! Yeah!

3815
03:32:47,360 --> 03:32:57,960
Take that! Take that! Ow! Ow! Okay! Which way? Ow! Oraya! That hurts! This hurts!

3816
03:32:57,960 --> 03:32:59,960
Where does it hurt? Your heart?

3817
03:32:59,960 --> 03:33:03,760
My heart hurts AND it physically hurts!

3818
03:33:03,760 --> 03:33:12,990
That's gonna break something...

3819
03:33:12,990 --> 03:33:16,790
Yeah, she's definitely hitting me a ton.

3820
03:33:16,790 --> 03:33:18,590
How about that!

3821
03:33:18,590 --> 03:33:20,390
Oh no!

3822
03:33:20,390 --> 03:33:27,840
You were acting all righteous!

3823
03:33:28,640 --> 03:33:31,140
We're brothers, aren't we!

3824
03:33:31,140 --> 03:33:37,980
No we're not!

3825
03:33:37,980 --> 03:33:40,980
Shoot her, use the gun!

3826
03:33:40,980 --> 03:33:47,380
We're partners!

3827
03:33:57,080 --> 03:33:58,080
Ugh!

3828
03:33:58,080 --> 03:34:04,980
Does that hurt?

3829
03:34:04,980 --> 03:34:06,980
Ow!

3830
03:34:06,980 --> 03:34:15,840
Where's Miko Miko?

3831
03:34:15,840 --> 03:34:17,540
Nowhere

3832
03:34:17,540 --> 03:34:18,540
to be found?

3833
03:34:18,540 --> 03:34:20,340
She's not here.

3834
03:34:20,340 --> 03:34:23,770
Oh, Miko Miko?

3835
03:34:23,770 --> 03:34:25,570
She's not here.

3836
03:34:25,570 --> 03:34:27,370
Let's just talk...

3837
03:34:27,370 --> 03:34:28,370
Let's be friends!

3838
03:34:28,370 --> 03:34:29,260
Aaaaaah!

3839
03:34:30,970 --> 03:34:32,970
Oraya!

3840
03:34:32,970 --> 03:34:54,210
A fistfight?!

3841
03:34:54,210 --> 03:35:00,410
It's like Mewtwo!

3842
03:35:00,410 --> 03:35:02,410
It's like Mewtwo Strikes Back!

3843
03:35:02,410 --> 03:35:06,210
Miko!

3844
03:35:06,210 --> 03:35:09,010
Korone!

3845
03:35:09,010 --> 03:35:11,810
Korone!

3846
03:35:11,810 --> 03:35:12,610
No!

3847
03:35:13,410 --> 03:35:15,870
Stop bowing like that!

3848
03:35:15,870 --> 03:35:18,420
Don't cry!

3849
03:35:18,420 --> 03:35:20,940
I don't want to do this either!

3850
03:35:20,940 --> 03:35:23,380
So many times

3851
03:35:23,380 --> 03:35:25,080
I've been betrayed

3852
03:35:25,080 --> 03:35:27,440
I was there through everything

3853
03:35:27,440 --> 03:35:29,440
I even saw you naked

3854
03:35:29,440 --> 03:35:31,820
And yet

3855
03:35:31,820 --> 03:35:33,820
why would you do this...

3856
03:35:33,820 --> 03:35:39,220
Hey, stop it, not that!

3857
03:35:39,220 --> 03:35:41,200
Don't do that!

3858
03:35:41,200 --> 03:35:44,120
You can't do that!

3859
03:35:44,120 --> 03:35:46,420
That's not fair!

3860
03:35:46,420 --> 03:35:47,420
That hurts!

3861
03:35:47,420 --> 03:35:50,500
That's not fair!

3862
03:35:50,500 --> 03:35:55,550
I can't do it!

3863
03:35:55,550 --> 03:36:06,660
I have a family!

3864
03:36:06,660 --> 03:36:09,960
Look at Cody's health bar!

3865
03:36:09,960 --> 03:36:12,260
He's about to die!

3866
03:36:12,260 --> 03:36:30,550
I didn't know that! I didn't know!

3867
03:36:30,550 --> 03:40:49,790
I had no idea!

3868
03:40:51,790 --> 03:41:04,670
This is so rough...

3869
03:41:04,670 --> 03:42:52,210
But you know, thinking about it—

3870
03:42:52,210 --> 03:42:53,310
on the flip side,

3871
03:42:53,310 --> 03:42:55,890
if we had killed him, he'd have to tell his wife

3872
03:42:55,890 --> 03:42:58,390
who's holding their baby...

3873
03:42:58,390 --> 03:43:03,430
That would've been rough too

3874
03:43:03,430 --> 03:43:05,430
Wait, are there two different endings?

3875
03:43:05,430 --> 03:43:07,200
Yeah, there are.

3876
03:43:07,200 --> 03:43:19,450
Did she come home?

3877
03:43:19,450 --> 03:43:39,160
Oh, baby!

3878
03:43:39,160 --> 03:43:50,070
It's a letter!

3879
03:43:50,070 --> 03:43:51,070
A letter!

3880
03:43:51,070 --> 03:43:54,630
A letter? A letter here?

3881
03:44:01,750 --> 03:44:07,210
"Give me one more chance"

3882
03:44:07,210 --> 03:44:14,830
He quit the police force, apparently.

3883
03:44:14,830 --> 03:44:20,910
He must have been so consumed by work.

3884
03:44:20,910 --> 03:44:30,180
Leo told him to write a letter

3885
03:44:30,180 --> 03:44:32,380
and he actually went and did it.

3886
03:44:32,380 --> 03:44:34,240
He really followed through!

3887
03:44:34,240 --> 03:44:36,190
Idiot! Idiot!

3888
03:44:36,190 --> 03:44:38,040
You idiot!

3889
03:44:38,040 --> 03:44:51,660
That's great though!

3890
03:44:51,660 --> 03:44:52,660
Yes!!

3891
03:44:52,660 --> 03:44:55,460
But I still feel a little... unsettled.

3892
03:44:55,460 --> 03:45:02,060
Yeah, that was a bit rough, honestly.

3893
03:45:02,060 --> 03:45:06,060
But I guess it couldn't be helped...

3894
03:45:12,610 --> 03:45:14,410
Wow...

3895
03:45:14,410 --> 03:45:16,410
Leo's ending...

3896
03:45:16,410 --> 03:46:43,890
We started this on Miko's channel on the 4th,

3897
03:46:43,890 --> 03:46:45,890
and this was a continuation from that session—

3898
03:46:45,890 --> 03:46:48,690
and we made it all the way to the end!

3899
03:46:48,690 --> 03:46:50,490
No way~!

3900
03:46:50,490 --> 03:47:01,070
Yeah, it really was like a movie.

3901
03:47:01,070 --> 03:47:02,160
Right?

3902
03:47:02,160 --> 03:47:05,930
Like, at the very end, I was thinking—

3903
03:47:05,930 --> 03:47:07,930
either way, they'd probably

3904
03:47:07,930 --> 03:47:09,930
end up getting caught again, right?

3905
03:47:09,930 --> 03:47:10,730
Yeah, I thought so too.

3906
03:47:10,730 --> 03:47:13,530
But it ended like this!

3907
03:47:13,530 --> 03:47:16,470
What a twist ending!

3908
03:47:16,470 --> 03:47:20,110
This game was absolutely amazing.

3909
03:47:20,110 --> 03:47:22,550
Way better than I expected.

3910
03:47:22,550 --> 03:47:23,290
Seriously.

3911
03:47:23,290 --> 03:47:26,690
Knowing the ending, a second playthrough would feel totally different.

3912
03:47:26,690 --> 03:47:27,530
Like, what you notice and focus on...

3913
03:47:27,530 --> 03:47:28,110
For sure.

3914
03:47:28,110 --> 03:47:32,210
Playing the other character's side is a whole different experience too.

3915
03:47:32,210 --> 03:47:33,090
Yeah, definitely.

3916
03:47:33,090 --> 03:47:35,990
You can totally enjoy this a second time.

3917
03:47:35,990 --> 03:47:39,090
I wonder if there's a true ending or something.

3918
03:47:39,090 --> 03:47:41,410
I think there are just two versions.

3919
03:47:41,410 --> 03:47:50,660
I figured one of them would end up dying at the end.

3920
